{"title":"2014 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Meta)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Meta)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The difference between a two-digit number and the number obtained by reversing its digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times the sum of the digits of either number.  What is the sum of the two digit number and its reverse?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/5/205f2da17edf43e25fc32ead41e6124d1510c55b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }44\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }55\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }77\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }99\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }110$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"407\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the two digits be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/6/256126fc768f9416ab2aeadc0767beb1561ba882.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5a + 5b = 10a + b - 10b - a = 9a - 9b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"302\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/a/a0a595eced02b78e23438c2a3fa064106e1b21bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = 7b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" />. This yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/1/9b1838491bea2799f90f459e5a942e9dd6d7c4c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/7/197213da9d06b2c5b59a10ad17f6a4aeb43d6697.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/8/a78210140ee0f08236c0129d621e7f9b2ed1bf56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b &lt; 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/a/61a70072b001b09ab1c8d62f788ac6fa4aa7afe5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72 + 27 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }99}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"151\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Meta.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Meta)\">Solution 2 (Meta)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Meta)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We start like above. Let the two digits be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/4/1644890d3d032678ace4b8b3ebe0071db505ad73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5(a+b) = 10a+b-10b-a=9(a-b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"310\" height=\"18\" />. Since we are looking for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/7/4b710980871dd9e8eb86ae94d9972b7f6df8ec55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10a+b+10b+a=11(a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"232\" height=\"18\" /> and we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> must be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the only answer choice that works is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/d/b7d7218154c753771775498974a6100314852d3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }99}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"69\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/rJytKoJzNBY\">https://youtu.be/rJytKoJzNBY</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A\" title=\"2014 AMC 12A\">2014 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2014 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">